        "description": "How a caller signs in (`auth.login {flow: …}`). On the wire, externally\ntagged: `{\"browser\": {\"redirect\": …}}`, `{\"code\": {\"code\", \"state\"}}`,\n`{\"password\": {\"username\", \"password\"}}`, `{\"session\": {\"ttl_secs\",\n\"ceiling\"}}`.",
